abel="Week starting">2 Nov 2026</td><td data-label="Part of launch">Baseline (first full week after launch)</td><td class="num" data-label="Sightings">50</td><td class="num" data-label="Not finished">10% · 5 of 50</td><td class="num" data-label="No cat in the photo">6% · 3 of 50</td><td class="num" data-label="Matched to a suggested cat">62% · 31 of 50</td><td class="num" data-label="Matched to a cat they found themselves">12% · 6 of 50</td><td class="num" data-label="A new cat">8% · 4 of 50</td><td class="num" data-label="Other or not recorded">2% · 1 of 50</td><td class="num" data-label="Matched to a known cat">82% · 37 of 45</td><td data-label="Matched against baseline">Baseline</td><td class="num" data-label="Of which the matcher was down">2</td></tr><tr><td data-label="Week starting">9 Nov 2026</td><td data-label="Part of launch">After launch</td><td class="num" data-label="Sightings">62</td><td class="num" data-label="Not finished">8% · 5 of 62</td><td class="num" data-label="No cat in the photo">5% · 3 of 62</td><td class="num" data-label="Matched to a suggested cat">50% · 31 of 62</td><td class="num" data-label="Matched to a cat they found themselves">10% · 6 of 62</td><td class="num" data-label="A new cat">6% · 4 of 62</td><td class="num" data-label="Other or not recorded">2% · 1 of 62</td><td class="num" data-label="Matched to a known cat">82% · 37 of 45</td><td data-label="Matched against baseline">Same as baseline</td><td class="num" data-label="Of which the matcher was down">2</td></tr><tr><td data-label="Week starting">16 Nov 2026</td><td data-label="Part of launch">After launch</td><td class="num" data-label="Sightings">19</td><td class="num" data-label="Not finished">Still open · 5 of 19</td><td class="num" data-label="No cat in the photo">3 of 19 · Too few to compare</td><td class="num" data-label="Matched to a suggested cat">31 of 19 · Too few to compare</td><td class="num" data-label="Matched to a cat they found themselves">6 of 19 · Too few to compare</td><td class="num" data-label="A new cat">4 of 19 · Too few to compare</td><td class="num" data-label="Other or not recorded">1 of 19 · Too few to compare</td><td class="num" data-label="Matched to a known cat">82% · 37 of 45</td><td data-label="Matched against baseline">Same as baseline</td><td class="num" data-label="Of which the matcher was down">2</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><p><a class="tap" href="/api/team/insights/launch-matched.csv?range=since" download>Download the share matched as a spreadsheet (CSV)</a></p></section><section id="accuracy"><h2>Matching accuracy</h2><p class="hint">Spotters are counted, never named or ranked.</p><p class="hbig">Right first time: <strong>53% · 60 of 114</strong></p><p class="hbig">Checked: <strong>88% right · 132 of 150</strong></p><p class="hbig">Corrected by the team: <strong>16% · 15 of 93</strong></p><p class="hint">The headline counts a suggestion nobody checked as right. The checked figure is the one to trust once it has enough behind it.</p><details class="astable"><summary>Show as table</summary><div class="tablewrap"><table class="rtable"><caption>Matching accuracy, by week</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Week starting</th><th scope="col">Part of launch</th><th scope="col" class="num">Right first time</th><th scope="col" class="num">Right, lower down</th><th scope="col" class="num">Suggested, then corrected</th><th scope="col" class="num">Missed, though compared</th><th scope="col" class="num">Missed, too far away</th><th scope="col" class="num">Missed, nothing to compare</th><th scope="col" class="num">Right first time (share of all six)</th><th scope="col">Right first time against baseline</th><th scope="col" class="num">Checked: share right</th><th scope="col" class="num">Corrected by the team (share of suggestions taken)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-label="Week starting">26 Oct 2026</td><td data-label="Part of launch">Launch days</td><td class="num" data-label="Right first time">2