scope="col" class="num">Share</th><th scope="col">Against baseline</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-label="Week starting">26 Oct 2026</td><td data-label="Part of launch">Launch days</td><td class="num" data-label="Finished sightings">40</td><td class="num" data-label="Spotter sent another within 7 days">10</td><td class="num" data-label="Share">25% · 10 of 40</td><td data-label="Against baseline"></td></tr><tr><td data-label="Week starting">2 Nov 2026</td><td data-label="Part of launch">Baseline (first full week after launch)</td><td class="num" data-label="Finished sightings">40</td><td class="num" data-label="Spotter sent another within 7 days">10</td><td class="num" data-label="Share">25% · 10 of 40</td><td data-label="Against baseline">Baseline</td></tr><tr><td data-label="Week starting">9 Nov 2026</td><td data-label="Part of launch">After launch</td><td class="num" data-label="Finished sightings">40</td><td class="num" data-label="Spotter sent another within 7 days">10</td><td class="num" data-label="Share">25% · 10 of 40</td><td data-label="Against baseline">Same as baseline</td></tr><tr><td data-label="Week starting">16 Nov 2026</td><td data-label="Part of launch">After launch</td><td class="num" data-label="Finished sightings">40</td><td class="num" data-label="Spotter sent another within 7 days">10</td><td class="num" data-label="Share">Still open · 10 of 40</td><td data-label="Against baseline"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><p><a class="tap" href="/api/team/insights/launch-follow.csv?range=since" download>Download the follow-up figures as a spreadsheet (CSV)</a></p></section><p class="hint" id="worked-out">Worked out 20 Nov 2026, 12:00 Syros time · since launch</p><details class="method"><summary>How this is worked out</summary><p class="hint">Counted by the day each cat was spotted. Sightings sent late are added to the week they were spotted, so recent weeks can still grow.</p><p class="hint">Sightings from spotters who have since deleted their account count as sightings, but not as spotters.</p><p class="hint">The Launch days row counts from launch day, so it can be lower than Coverage&#39;s figure for that week.</p><p class="hint">Weeks are Athens weeks. The baseline is the first full week (Monday to Sunday) that starts on or after the launch date; every later week is set against it, with no colour, because without targets a rise isn&#39;t automatically good.</p><p class="hint">A week with fewer than 20 sightings behind a percentage shows the count and greys the percentage.</p><p class="hint">Not finished is only fair 48 hours after a week ends, so the current week is Still open. That 48 hours is this report&#39;s rule, not something the app records.</p><p class="hint">Other or not recorded should be near zero. If it isn&#39;t, that is a fault worth a ticket.</p><p class="hint">Testers can&#39;t be marked, so any tester still active after launch is counted.</p><p class="hint">Matcher down or timed out is a share of sightings; a timeout is about 35 seconds and is left out of the typical wait.</p><p class="hint">Sightings with no phone wait are those saved for later, sent before the update, or over 10 minutes.</p><p class="hint">The headline counts a suggestion nobody checked as right. The checked figure is the one to trust once it has enough behind it.</p><p class="hint">The follow card isn&#39;t switched on yet. This is the &#39;before&#39; figure it will be compared against.</p><p class="hint">Figures change as records are corrected.</p></details></main></body></html>"
`;

